      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "A rig built from your own nodes\n\n1. Your loaders go into Rig Model. Wire its model into your sampler. The Workspace adds this rig's LoRAs and camera LoRAs to it for you.\n2. Rig Inputs hands your sampler the prompts, latent, seed, steps, CFG, sampler, scheduler and denoise from the Workspace.\n3. Your sampler's latent goes into Rig Result.\n\nOn the Workspace, the Models tab has a rig named My rig of kind Your own nodes. Type your prompt on the Prompts tab and queue. There are no wires to the Workspace: the three rig nodes find it by the rig name. Swap the KSampler for any sampler you like."
      ]
